  "blocks": [
   {
    "id": "p1",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Imagine such a vehicle: With the back of a "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "pickup truck",
      "zh": "小卡车"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ", it can carry both passengers and "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "cargo",
      "zh": "货物"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". It’s easy to drive. And it’s "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "affordable",
      "ref": "v-affordable"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " and requires no fuel. Doesn’t that sound too good to be true? Well, it’s not really "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "unimaginable",
      "ref": "v-unimaginable"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". I’m talking about a Chinese-made electric tricycle, or "
     },
     {
      "t": "em",
      "v": "Sanbengzi"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p2",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "In October 2023, a Chinese vlogger bought a "
     },
     {
      "t": "em",
      "v": "Sanbengzi"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " for her American father-in-law. As soon as the vehicle arrived in the U.S., it drew attention from locals. People were amazed. Some even offered to buy the tricycle. But it’s not just in the U.S. You can also hear the warning sound—“Please watch out! I’m "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "backing up",
      "zh": "倒车"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "!”—on the streets of France, the U.K., and Canada. Some Western netizens have even called "
     },
     {
      "t": "em",
      "v": "Sanbengzi"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " their “dream vehicle”."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "As the "
     },
     {
      "t": "underline",
      "v": "buzz"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " grew, I wondered: This tricycle has long been popular across China. Why has it only recently made waves in the West?"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Guowei"
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "",
      "zh": "国威"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " is a major manufacturer of "
     },
     {
      "t": "em",
      "v": "Sanbengzi"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " in Wuxi, Jiangsu. When I stepped into the factory, I was greeted by a busy scene. Skilled workers were carefully putting the vehicles together. Rows of "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "brand-new",
      "zh": "崭新的"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " blue tricycles stood ready for "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "shipment",
      "ref": "v-shipment"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " abroad."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p5",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "I spoke with Ni Xiaofeng, Guowei’s general manager. He told me that since the beginning of 2024, orders from abroad had been increasing rapidly. Ni believes the tricycle’s newfound popularity isn’t "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "accidental",
      "ref": "v-accidental"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". The vehicle is inexpensive and very "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "practical",
      "ref": "v-practical"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ", and it works well on many different types of roads."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p6",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Many Westerners are now looking for greener ways to get around. This has given Guowei a golden opportunity to expand into foreign markets. To suit "
     },
     {
      "t": "em",
      "v": "Sanbengzi"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " to local needs across different markets, the company has done a lot of research. As a result, the company has developed over 100 tricycle models."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p7",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "More and more consumers around the world are choosing made-in-China products. "
     },
     {
      "t": "em",
      "v": "Sanbengzi"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "’s success is just one of the latest examples. People love Chinese products for their affordability, quality, and creativity. As we look to the future, one thing is almost certain: Even more goods from China will shine on the world stage."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
